  ('romantic', 'Draw each other', 'Sit face to face and sketch each other for five minutes. Reveal at the same time and try not to laugh.', 15, 'offline_fun', true, 'premium'),
  ('romantic', 'Build a blanket fort', 'Chairs, sheets, pillows. Build it properly, then spend some time inside.', 25, 'offline_fun', true, 'premium'),
